<title>LITHUANIA: BOURSE SUSPENDS TRADE IN SIAULIU BANK.</title>
<headline>BOURSE SUSPENDS TRADE IN SIAULIU BANK.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lithuanian National Stock Exchange said on Thursday it was suspending trade in the shares of Siauliu Bank from March 17 to March 24 because the bank was holding its general shareholders' meeting that week.</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
